`fid 335-04` MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` WITH
    `the calendar year of the period`                                          IS 2026
    `an employee or a self-employed person`                                    IS FALSE
    `an Israeli resident`                                                      IS FALSE
    `insured under Chapter 11`                                                 IS FALSE
    `a housewife as defined in section 238`                                    IS FALSE
    `a widow pensioner as defined in section 238`                              IS FALSE
    `insured under Chapter 5`                                                  IS FALSE
    `insured under Chapter 6`                                                  IS FALSE
    `insured under paragraph (1) of the definition of insured in section 158`  IS FALSE
    `a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company`                      IS FALSE
