-- 335-07: housewife (s 238), s 335 alone: accident injury, disability, long-term care.
-- (335-R3: the export is labelled "under National Insurance Law s 335", which RD-6 accepts.)
`fid 335-07` MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` WITH
    `the calendar year of the period`                                          IS 2026
    `an employee or a self-employed person`                                    IS FALSE
    `an Israeli resident`                                                      IS TRUE
